==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Magneton|82}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Magneton}}.
*'''Spinning Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Staryu|S3}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 3}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

